WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:02.067
-Welcome, everybody.

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.567
Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:05.100
What a show we got
for you tonight.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.434
Well, guys, this should put you
in an even better mood.

00:00:09.434 --> 00:00:11.501
Today is
National Drink Beer Day.

00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:14.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.200
I understood
when some of my writers

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.133
stayed home Monday and Tuesday
for Rosh Hashanah,

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:19.167
but today was pushing it.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:20.501
It was like, "Really."

00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:22.701
Yeah, it's a day
that always starts off fun,

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:23.801
then ends with, "No, Officer,

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:25.601
you have the right
to remain silent."

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:26.767
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:28.868
Yep, National Drink Beer Day,

00:00:28.868 --> 00:00:31.167
and, of course, for all those
who don't celebrate,

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:32.567
there's Coors Light.

00:00:32.567 --> 00:00:34.567
Yeah.
[ Laughter, scattered applause ]

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:38.234
Let's get to some news.
Thank you.

00:00:38.234 --> 00:00:40.234
Well, guys, today
former president Trump

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:42.634
said that the war
between Russia and Ukraine

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:44.767
would have never happened
if he were in office.

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:46.734
And even --

00:00:46.734 --> 00:00:51.334
He even offered to lead peace
talks between the two countries.

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:54.200
Yeah, Trump said, "I'm an expert
on foreign affairs.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.434
I've had affairs
with many foreigners."

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:59.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.067
Just to talk.

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:07.400
Speaking of Trump,
according to a new book,

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.100
at one point
during his presidency,

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:12.400
he nearly fired Ivanka and Jared
over Twitter.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:16.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.133
Meanwhile, Eric and Don Jr.
were like, "Wait a minute.

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:19.634
He follows you guys on Twitter?"

00:01:19.634 --> 00:01:21.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.501
Well, listen to this.

00:01:22.501 --> 00:01:23.901
Apparently Democratic insiders
are impressed

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:26.734
with Gavin Newsom's recent
criticism of Republicans,

00:01:26.734 --> 00:01:29.501
and some think that he's
gearing up to run for president.

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:31.601
[ Cheering, booing ]

00:01:31.601 --> 00:01:32.767
It's int-- Ooh.

00:01:32.767 --> 00:01:34.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:36.701
-Oh, yeah.
-That was great.

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:39.901
It was like -- 'Cause everyone
was on this side of the crowd

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:42.367
and then -- just very odd, yeah.

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:43.667
I think it's just
very interesting.

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:46.868
'Cause if you put Newsom
in one of those aging apps,

00:01:46.868 --> 00:01:48.534
you pretty much get Joe Biden.

00:01:48.534 --> 00:01:50.000
And I just thought
that's very interesting.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.133
Very similar.

00:01:51.133 --> 00:01:52.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:54.133
A little tweak up.

00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:56.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:56.634 --> 00:01:58.400
Hey, guys, I heard that Kia

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:01.968
recalled 70,000 Sorento
and Sportage SUVs

00:02:01.968 --> 00:02:06.434
after multiple reports of fires
and localized melting incidents.

00:02:06.434 --> 00:02:08.133
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:09.734
Kia was like, "Look,
on the bright side,

00:02:09.734 --> 00:02:11.501
you now have the world's biggest
panini maker."

00:02:11.501 --> 00:02:14.267
So that's pretty good.
I mean...

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:17.968
Apparently, the tow hitch
in the back can melt.

00:02:17.968 --> 00:02:20.701
My question is, who's towing
something with a Kia?

00:02:20.701 --> 00:02:22.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:26.067 --> 00:02:28.067
"Want me to move
that tricycle for you?

00:02:28.067 --> 00:02:29.801
Hook her up to the back.
Let's go.

00:02:29.801 --> 00:02:32.100
Move that --
Let's go, ant.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.701
Let's go.
We're gonna go down the..."

00:02:34.701 --> 00:02:36.767
Well, get this --
McDonald's just announced

00:02:36.767 --> 00:02:38.701
that they're going to
start selling Happy Meals

00:02:38.701 --> 00:02:40.100
with toys for adults.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:43.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:43.334 --> 00:02:45.767
♪♪

00:02:45.767 --> 00:02:49.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.200
Yep.
Happy Meals with adult toys.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.901
What could possibly go wrong?

00:02:52.901 --> 00:02:55.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.267 --> 00:02:56.667
Some more business news.

00:02:56.667 --> 00:02:58.400
For the first time in 10 years,

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:02.000
M&amp;M'S are adding a new character
to the mix, a purple peanut M&amp;M.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.167
Here she is.

00:03:03.167 --> 00:03:05.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:05.868 --> 00:03:08.801
Yeah.
A purple peanut M&amp;M.

00:03:08.801 --> 00:03:11.534
Yeah, I guess the blue and red
M&amp;M'S date went really well.

00:03:11.534 --> 00:03:14.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.901 --> 00:03:16.000
♪♪

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.434
-Adult toys.
-Alright, alright.

00:03:18.434 --> 00:03:21.133
-That's not Grimace.

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:22.801
[ Rim shot ]

00:03:22.801 --> 00:03:25.667
-Switching gears,

00:03:25.667 --> 00:03:29.133
Pokémon just unveiled
a new character called Wiglett.

00:03:29.133 --> 00:03:30.601
Take a look at this.

00:03:30.601 --> 00:03:33.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.934 --> 00:03:38.267
That's one of the toys
in the adult Happy Meal.

00:03:38.267 --> 00:03:39.367
Yeah, that's exactly right.
Yeah.

00:03:39.367 --> 00:03:42.200
-Oh, my God.
-Did you guys see this?

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.701
Last night at a concert in D.C.,

00:03:43.701 --> 00:03:45.968
Lizzo played
a never-used crystal flute

00:03:45.968 --> 00:03:48.467
that once belonged
to President James Madison.

00:03:48.467 --> 00:03:49.567
-Ooh.

00:03:49.567 --> 00:03:51.801
-No one had played it
in 200 years.

00:03:51.801 --> 00:03:53.601
So it was about damn time.

00:03:53.601 --> 00:03:55.968
There you go.
That's right.

